%% Buyurtma oqimi: xaridordan topshirishgacha
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor X as Xaridor
    participant V as Vitrina
    participant O as OMS
    participant P as To'lov provayderi
    participant F as Filial (yig'uvchi)
    participant D as Dispetcher / kuryer
    participant N as Xabarnoma

    X->>V: Manzil (pin + mo'ljal)
    V->>O: GET /zones/resolve
    O-->>V: Filial, katalog, tarif, slotlar
    X->>V: Savat, slot, to'lov, almashtirish qoidasi
    V->>O: POST /orders (Idempotency-Key)
    O->>O: Qoldiq + slot atomar rezerv
    O-->>V: 201 Buyurtma raqami
    alt Onlayn to'lov
        V->>P: To'lov sahifasi
        P-->>O: Webhook: paid (imzoli)
    end
    O->>F: Yangi buyurtma (navbat)
    F->>O: Yig'ish: vazn / muqobil
    alt Summa rozilik chegarasidan oshdi
        O->>N: Tasdiq so'rovi
        N-->>X: SMS / Telegram
        X->>O: Tasdiqlash yoki rad etish
    end
    F->>O: Tayyor / qadoqlandi
    O->>D: Jo'natma yaratildi
    D->>O: Biriktirildi → olib ketildi
    O->>N: Kuzatuv havolasi (token)
    N-->>X: Havola
    D->>O: Topshirildi (PIN / surat)
    O->>N: Chek + baholash
    N-->>X: Chek va yordam havolasi
